Description: methylTFR is an R package designed for identifying
    variable methylation patterns within transcription factor binding sites (TFBS) across sets of annotations. 
    It is designed primarily for single-cell or whole-genome bisulfate sequencing data and its variations.
License: Artistic-2.0
URL: https://github.com/EpigenomeInformatics/methylTFR
